    "objective": "Use the post as a passer to create open threes and re-seal for a better post catch.",
    "setup": "Post on the block; shooters at the wing and top; a post defender and a digger.",
    "organization": "Rotate every four reps.",
    "instructions": [
      "The wing enters to the post.",
      "The digger helps; the post kicks to the open shooter.",
      "Immediately reposts: seal the defender with the hip.",
